{"date":"2026-10-09","level":"n4_lite","title":"はじめてのいけばな教室","text":"先週、はじめていけばな教室に行ってみた。先生が花の切り方や並べ方を丁寧に教えてくれたので、なんとなく形を作ることができた。思ったより難しかったけど、花に触れているうちに心が落ち着いてきて、また通いたいと思った。","tokens":[{"surface_form":"先週","basic_form":"先週","reading":"せんしゅう","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"はじめて","basic_form":"はじめて","reading":"はじめて","pos":"副詞"},{"surface_form":"いけばな教室","basic_form":"いけばな教室","reading":"いけばなきょうしつ","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"行ってみた","basic_form":"行く","reading":"いってみた","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"。","basic_form":"。","reading":"。","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"先生","basic_form":"先生","reading":"せんせい","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"が","basic_form":"が","reading":"が","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"花","basic_form":"花","reading":"はな","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"の","basic_form":"の","reading":"の","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"切り方","basic_form":"切り方","reading":"きりかた","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"や","basic_form":"や","reading":"や","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"並べ方","basic_form":"並べ方","reading":"ならべかた","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"を","basic_form":"を","reading":"を","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"丁寧","basic_form":"丁寧","reading":"ていねい","pos":"形容詞"},{"surface_form":"に","basic_form":"に","reading":"に","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"教えてくれた","basic_form":"教える","reading":"おしえてくれた","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"ので","basic_form":"ので","reading":"ので","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"、","basic_form":"、","reading":"、","pos":"記号"},{"surface_form":"なんとなく","basic_form":"なんとなく","reading":"なんとなく","pos":"副詞"},{"surface_form":"形","basic_form":"形","reading":"かたち","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"を","basic_form":"を","reading":"を","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"作る","basic_form":"作る","reading":"つくる","pos":"動詞"},{"surface_form":"こと","basic_form":"こと","reading":"こと","pos":"名詞"},{"surface_form":"が","basic_form":"が","reading":"が","pos":"助詞"},{"surface_form":"できた","basic_form":"できる","reading":"できた","pos":"動詞"},{